<view class="page page-enter" wx:if="{{lead}}">
  <view class="card"><view class="lead-name">{{lead.childName}}</view><view class="muted lead-meta">{{lead.gender}} · {{lead.birthday}} · {{lead.school}} · {{lead.grade}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="between"><text class="muted">家长</text><text>{{lead.parentName}}</text></view><view class="between info"><text class="muted">手机号</text><text>{{lead.mobile}}</text></view><view class="between info"><text class="muted">招生来源</text><text>{{lead.source}}</text></view><view class="between info"><text class="muted">备注</text><text>{{lead.remark || '无'}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="field"><text class="field-label">孩子照片 *</text><view class="avatar-upload" bindtap="avatar"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else>{{uploading ? '正在上传...' : '＋ 从相册选择或拍照'}}</view></view><view class="muted small photo-help">正式建档必填，仅用于俱乐部内部身份确认</view></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="field-label">报名日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{registrationDate}}" bindchange="registrationDate"><view class="picker">{{registrationDate}}</view></picker></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="field-label">招生负责人</text><picker range="{{coaches}}" range-key="name" value="{{coachIndex}}" bindchange="coach"><view class="picker">{{coaches[coachIndex].name || lead.ownerCoachName || '暂未分配'}}</view></picker></view>
    <view class="notice">本步骤只创建正式学员档案，不会自动加入班级或变更课时。家长绑定、管理员编班和课程购买需分别通过对应流程完成。</view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{uploading}}" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">转为正式学员</button>
</view>
